# Build artifacts
dist/
*.iso
*.cpio.gz
# Leading slash matters: a bare "simpleclient" pattern also matches the
# cmd/simpleclient/ directory, which would silently exclude the entry point
# from the repository.
/simpleclient

# Scratch design notes get written at the top level and are not worth keeping.
# The pattern is anchored so it stays out of docs/ and .github/, which hold
# documentation that is meant to be read.
/*.md
!/README.md

# Go
# vendor/ is committed on purpose: the grdp dependency does not compile on Linux
# without local patches. See build/patches/ and build/vendor-patch.sh.
*.test
*.out

# Editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/

# Agent tooling. Loosening the *.md rule above so docs/ could be tracked pulled
# .agents/ in with it; none of this is project content.
.agents/
skills-lock.json
